OL,3,GNEWSASteelworkers in hospital after gas
OL,4,Aleak report
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive workers at Scunthorpe steelworks
OL,7,Fhave been taken to hospital following
OL,8,Freports of a gas leak.
OL,10,FFirefighters were called to the site on
OL,11,FTuesday morning but when they arrived
OL,12,Fstaff had stemmed the leak and they
OL,13,Fleft shortly afterwards, Humberside
OL,14,FFire & Rescue Service said.
OL,16,FBritish Steel said: "Six colleagues
OL,17,Freceived treatment from our on-site
OL,18,Fteams and emergency services.
OL,19,FSubsequently, five of these colleagues
OL,20,Fwere taken to hospital for further
OL,21,Fsupport and monitoring."
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
